==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*derьmо}}. Related to {{m|ru|драть|t=to tear off}}. Sense of a recreational drug is a {{sl|ru|en|shit|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|дерьмо́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-дерьмо.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|d|дерьмо́|n=sg|aug=дерьми́ще}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} [[shit]], [[crap]] ([[excrement]])
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вот|Вот]] '''дерьмо́'''!|Oh, shit! (vulgar)
}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] [[полный|по́лном]] '''дерьме́'''|up shit creek; in deep shit; screwed; fucked}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|slang}} [[shit]], [[crap]] ([[stuff]], [[thing]]s)
#: {{syn|ru|барахли́шко|говно}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|slang}} [[scumbag]], [[shithead]] (a bad person)
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|slang}} [[shit]], any [[recreational drug]]
#* {{quote-song|ru|url=https://genius.com/Malenkyi-yarche-bestie-lyrics|title=BESTIE|lyricist=Маленький ярче |album=ANDERFUL ELF|track=1|date=2023-11-03|passage=Мы ку́рим '''дерьмо́''' в оте́ле,<br/>по́хуй на зако́ны|t=We be smoking '''shit''' in the hotel<br/>Not giving a toss about laws}}

